window.products.push({"id":981033,"name":"Fletchers' Mill 2.8\" Diameter Wood Biscuit Cutter, , Baking Tools, Great Gift Idea MADE in U.S.A.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174IOF6Y+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This fletchers’ mill Biscuit cutter features a sharp edge to make biscuits like your grandmother used to. This 2. 8” diameter round Biscuit cutter features a domed top with hole that eliminates suction for perfect-sized biscuits. Clean with a damp cloth and to wipe dry. It is made in Maine from solid new England hardwoods. Fletchers' Mill is a family owned company. For two generations, The Fletcher' Family has owned and operated The finest mills and manufacturing facilities for crafting wood pepper mills, salt mills, muddlers and Rolling pins. Tradition and wisdom passed down from a family of roll-up-your-sleeves American entrepreneurs, the current generation of Fletcher grew up in the company before taking ownership, working in the business from the sawmills through the mechanics to management - knowing the business from top to bottom. In the modernized sawmill, local Maple or cherry logs are processed into boards, squares and dowels and then kiln dried. The prepared wood is then turned or molded into one of the thousands of items. Most of the sawdust and scrap wood generated is used to heat Our factories and kilns and the rest sold to local business who manufacture wood pellets used to heat homes. Located in the Western Mountains of Maine, sourcing wood locally and from forest Stewardship Council (fsw) certified suppliers, employing around 100 people - Fletchers' Mill represents quality, community, sustainability and craftsmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174IOF6Y+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fletchers Mill","source_asin":"B07DN1L4RM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DN1L4RM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DN1L4RM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
