window.products.push({"id":981065,"name":"FerrisBuilt We Sleep Around Sign - Camper Trailer Accessories Inside Décor - camper trailer must haves - 8x10 Unframed Print on Thick Cardstock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717vEKgxpML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a fun and punny piece of art for your camper trailer walls? Look no further than the \"we sleep around\" 8x10 black and white print camper decoration for trailer walls. This camper trailer must haves sign is great for camper indoor accessories for travel trailers. This print comes on high quality lustr finish photo paper and is ready to frame or even use double stick tape and hang it up as is to keep it light as possible. AMAZON PRIME FREE SHIPPING & EASY RETURNS FOR 30 DAYS: Once I package the items I send them to Amazon for processing so that you can take advantage of quick free prime shipping and easy Amazon returns if you happen to be unhappy with the prints. The art prints are packaged in rigid packaging to prevent any damage to the prints on their way to you. HANDMADE IN SEATTLE, WA : Prints are handmade out of my studio in Seattle, Washington. I design the art either digitally or by hand and print from my studio or work with a printing partner. I personally inspect each one for quality before packaging. ART PRINTS MAKE WONDERFUL, EASY AND THOUGHTFUL GIFTS : Finding gifs for the hard to shop for, or want to a handmade touch, art prints are great for this! You can buy frames that are perfect for your gift recipient, frame the prints, wrap them up and give a handmade and thoughtful gift. You can even wrap up the prints as is as they come in rigid packaging that is easy to wrap with no pricing or information inside the packaging. WANT MORE FERRISBUILT HANDMADE ART? I create art prints and original handcrafted wood art pieces out of my shop in Seattle, you can view more of my work by clicking on “FerrisBuilt” above the product name at the top of this page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717vEKgxpML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FerrisBuilt","source_asin":"B08JWNN46L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JWNN46L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JWNN46L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981066,"name":"Fukosila Oil Sprayer for Cooking, Upgraded Olive Oil Sprayer for Air Fryer Glass Oil Mister Rotatable Nozzle Oil Spritzer Dispenser Bottle Kitchen Gad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sph72YTKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgraded Rotary Nozzle- Fukosila oil sprayer adopt upgraded fan-shaped atomizing nozzle, the nozzle can be rotated and removed for cleaning, you can turn the nozzle and control the pressure to obtain 100% even atomization, while keeping the nozzle clean and free of oil dripping from the nozzle. (Note: the atomization effect will be affected by the distance and consistency of the liquid you fill) Food Grade GLASS- Fukosila oil spray bottle is made of thickened lead-free glass, food-grade BPA free material, with high transparency, which is easy to identify the seasoning in the bottle. Why choose a glass oil spritzer? The glass material is resistant to high temperature, safer to eat and easier to clean. Bottom anti-slip thread design, anti-slip more stable, not suitable for dishwashers. Oil Control Healthy Diet- Fukosila olive oil mister consistently dispense 1g (0.2 teaspoon) per spray precisely control oil and reduce oil intake while enjoying delicious food. Covering food with less oil makes it easy to control your calories and is loved by fitness people and wellness families alike. Press the sprayer handle firmly and quickly to the end, spray out a fan-shaped mist, and press it halfway to get a columnar effect. Leakproof And Cloggingproof- The large opening design of the oil Sprayer makes it easy to refill without a funnel, and the classic screw interface is tightly sealed to prevent leakage. Detachable nozzles can be removed by turning counter-clockwise for individual cleaning without clogging. The spray head is made of high-quality PP frosted material, which is comfortable to hold and not easy to slip off. Morandi colors of Fukosila oil sprayer makes your counter more fashionable and beautiful. Widely Used- Fukosila oil sprayer is a practical kitchen gadget for olive oil, canola oil, avocado oil, vegetable oil, corn oil, vinegar, soy sauce, cooking wine and more. In addition, it can be widely used in air fryer, cooking, roasting turkey, frying steak, BBQ, salad making, etc. It is a good partner for kitchen, party, picnic, restaurant. Olive oil sprayer for cooking is popular with chefs, gourmets and is the perfect accessory for air fryers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sph72YTKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fukosila","source_asin":"B0BB5HDXF4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB5HDXF4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB5HDXF4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
