window.products.push({"id":981186,"name":"PARK&OZ ( 2 Pack ) Turkish Cotton Lightweight Towel | Pre-Washed | Absorbent and Quick Dry | Sand Free | Oversized | Towels for Beach,Pool,Bathroom,Sp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VP-8-TdcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐳 Lightweight, Oversized & Absorbent: Be amazed by the convenience of a Peshtemal, Turkish Towel! The special cotton weave allows for the fabric to be thin and absorbent. Towels are almost 40% larger than your average beach towel. Fantastic for families! 🐳 Toallas Turcas Peshtemal: Las toallas Turcas son perfectas para la playa, la piscina y los viajes. De secado rapido, son ligeras y son absorbentes. Aunque son aplios vas a ahorrar mucho más espacio en tu bolsa gracias a la tela fina. 100% algodón. 🐳 Perfect Traveling Companion: Replace your bulky towel with this compact, lighter option on your next adventure! You can easily roll it up and save tons of space in your bag, backpack or suitcase. Whether you are camping, road tripping or flying, you will be thankful for the extra space! 🐳 Fast Drying & Versatile: Air dry these babies without a care in the world! Thanks to the thin nature of the cotton fabric, these towels quickly dry between uses and avoid the funky smell damp towels get. Can be fashioned into a sarong, cover up or draped on shoulders as a shawl. Use in place of your bath towels if your bathroom tends to be humid. 🐳 Multipurpose Fitness Essential: Gym? Yoga? Physical Therapy? Check, Check, Check! Easily fits in a gym bag and can be used as a strap when you don’t have one on hand! Great for relaxing spa days as well! Practice yoga outdoors and during trips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VP-8-TdcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PARK & OZ","source_asin":"B0BRGJX1R7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRGJX1R7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRGJX1R7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
