window.products.push({"id":981195,"name":"SOPTICE 32 oz Water Bottle with Time Marker, 1 Liter Water Bottle with Straw, Motivational Water Bottle with Strap, BPA Free Reusable Water Bottle, 1L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711zga8-zTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"32 OZ Large Water Bottle - The clear water bottle size: 11.5 × 3 inch, 32oz/ 1000ml of water is enough for most people to drink for half a day. Silicone mouthpieces are soft and comfortable to put in your mouth. The translucent matte bottle body (only Narcissus & Sunflower) is silky to the touch. This water bottle with straw also comes with waterproof insulated sleeve and adjustable shoulder strap, suitable for teenagers and adults. Practical And Convenient Lid - Our sports water bottle featured with a Food-Grade silicone seal ring and safety lock, water bottle is 100% leakproof no matter if it is inverted or shaken. With a Spring-Loaded dust cover, you can open the lid with one hand by pressing button. The lid of cup can be pulled to 180° to prevent pressing your nose when drinking. The lid has a silicone non-slip ring around the edge for easy grip and a non-removable wrist strap. Light Weight And Stylish - SOPTICE reusable water bottle made of Food-Grade tritan material, the matte and translucent body is beautiful stylish and comfortable to the touch. The daily water intake bottle is not only 100% BPA-Free and Non-toxic, but also durable & shatter-resistant. This 1 liter water bottle comes with time markers & motivational quotes on the side so you can see your daily water intake and stay on track meet your health and fitness goals. Multifunction Neoprene Sleeve - The BPA free water bottle sleeve is made of neoprene to protect the water bottle from minor bumps and scratches. And it also keeps the ice water in the bottle from \"sweating\" while on your desk, avoid getting your hands dirty or anything else nearby. Exterior pocket is large enough to hold a 6.7'' phone. Coming with an adjustable and detachable padded strap (25\" To 50\"), giving you more carrying and hands-free options. Warm Tips And Guarantee - Our 32 oz water bottles are available in a variety of colors. Additional replacement straw and rubber gasket are included. Bottle and Neoprene sleeve are both hand wash only, rinse in baking Soda or the vinegar to eliminate odors before first use. If you have any questions or issues regarding the SOPTICE daily water bottle with time marker please reach out through Amazon and we'll respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711zga8-zTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOPTICE","source_asin":"B0B1GR73QZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981195","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1GR73QZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1GR73QZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
