window.products.push({"id":981216,"name":"Mini Bag Sealer with Cutter, 2 in 1 Handheld Sealer for Plastic Bags,Portable Snack Bag Sealer Machine, Small Heat Sealer with Magnet, Food Fresh Save","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jRXkEZ0AL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Quick sealing. The handheld mini sealer is a heat sealer, but no need to pre-heat it. When you want to seal up the snack bags, just slide the cover, put the bag between the white parts of the heater, press heavily, then move the sealer slowly along the bag.Quick and convenient.Notice: only works for plastic bags(PP,PE) and aluminium foil bag with thickness more than 0.1mm.(usually most of the snack bags work.) 2 in 1 multi-functions.This mini bag sealer is designed with compact size and fashion shape, a mini cutter is hidden on another end of the sealer. When you need to open the snack bags or package, just need to push the button up, the sealer becomes a cutter! Magnetic back.There is a magnetic pad designed on this mini sealer machine.You can put it on the fridge, use it to seal and cut any time you want. Safe patent design.The safe slide cover is a patent design, when you don't use the sealer, slide the cover back,then you can't press the heating points together, protecting the sealer from overheating by false operations, prolonging the machine's lifetime. NOTE: this sealer requires 2 AA alkaline batteries to work (NOT included in package) Light weight and mini size. It's only 65g for the bag sealer, you can put it in your pocket or bags, take it with you anywhere, it will help you keep the delicious snacks just as the original taste when they are opened, and fresh food still fresh, no worry for waste any more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jRXkEZ0AL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GO-VOLMON","source_asin":"B088QDNPHR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088QDNPHR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088QDNPHR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
