window.products.push({"id":981220,"name":"Quilted Thick Foam Recliner Slipcover Recliner Chair Cover Recliner Covers for Large Recliner, Furniture Protector with 2\" Straps, Seat Width Up to 28","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J7kjytj5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPGRADED VERSION: This luxury reversible foam quilted furniture protector provide more soft, thick, and comfortable seating option and give your pets a paw massage experience. Crafted from 85gsm thick microfiber soft material, filled with thick foam, the real quilted seam ensure the protector is durable and long lasting. Added 3 side pockets to hold remote controls, books and glasses, dress your home in sophistication and ultimate elegancy FANTASTIC FEATURES: Compare normals, our furniture covers have won the 3 points: 1) Real quilted with checked pattern, presentable and timelss, avoid falling out of the inside wadding after several washing, keep fresh and new after year and year; 2) Foam filled instead of polyester wadding, provide better neat and bouncy visually appealing and eye-catching, bring warm and cozy sitting feeling; 3) Water repellent against spills, pets fur, stains, wear and tear or any possible mess and accidents PERFECT FIT: We developed the product with guildline \"one size fits most\", match well for your most different styles of furnitures. 6 measures options: Seat width up to Chair: 24\"; Recliner: 28\"; Love Seat: 54\"; Futon: 70\"; Sofa: 70\"; Oversized Sofa: 78\", and 7 multiple reversible colors available: Burgundy / Tan, Grey / Beige, Brown / Beige, Smoke Blue / Beige, Beige / Tan, Taupe / Beige, Black / Grey, very easy to brighten up your existed home decor UNIQUE DECOR: Fashion over Function. These attractive quilted texture, soft foam filled, microfiber...holds all of the perfect elements and generated the protector is just like a personal customized gorgeous style. With 2\" wide ultra strong and adjustable strap to secure the cover in place and help prevent slipping and sliding. Immediately updated the look and decor of your home without breaking the budget EASY CARE: Whenever it needs a quick pick-me-up, just toss this piece in the washing machine for effortless upkeep. Separately in cold water on the gentle cycle, do not use bleach. Easy dry after washing. Kindly note though our innovated material has featured water prevent, but it is not 100% water proof, we suggest you remove it within 5 minutes after any accident","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J7kjytj5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H.VERSAILTEX","source_asin":"B07S6JY5QP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S6JY5QP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S6JY5QP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
