window.products.push({"id":981253,"name":"4 EVER WINNER Coffee Bar Cabinet, Framhouse Bar Cabinet Modern Storage Cabinet Rolling Sideboard Buffet Storage Cabinet Accent Cabinet Kitchen Island ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714GlnuRU5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: This coffee bar cabinet on wheels which is an ideal choice for your kitchen or dining room. The frame is made of premium PB and MDF, so this coffee bar cabinet with storage is sturdy and durable enough for long time use. Features two drawers and two cabinets which provide ample storage space for you to organize your items. The rubber wood top also provides extra counter space for kitchen to prepare delicious food. Two convenient handles make it more comfortable for push or you can use it as towel racks. Equipped with 4 rolling casters for easy movement, and 2 of them are lockable to ensure the stability while using the small kitchen island. Feature: -Maximize kitchen space and provide additional storage -With cart handle and towel rack -Elegant and smooth surface -Regular telescopic channel -Rolling island for kitchen -Easy to move with four flexible swivel wheels Specification: Material: Rubber Wood and MDF Color: Black and Natural Product dimension: 48.5”L x 18.5”W x 35.5”H Item Weight: 87.5 lbs Package include: 1x Coffee Bar Cabinet 1x Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714GlnuRU5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"4 EVER WINNER","source_asin":"B09927SRP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09927SRP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09927SRP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981254,"name":"Stainless steel French Press Double Screen Better Filtering No Coffee Grounds Top Quality Construction Durable Long-Lasting By Kitchsmart (34 Oz, Coff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aNmSVxIfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Delectable Coffee – There is no better way to get a kick-start on the day than drinking a cup of rejuvenating coffee in the morning. You can even take it “to go” but a shot of caffeine with breakfast is a must, and that is exactly why you need the Kitchsmart French Press coffee maker in your kitchen. . Double Screen – This is the first coffee press to implement the dual screen system, giving it an edge over other varieties in the market. The primary screen touches the glass wall more tightly and evenly, while the second screen expertly filters the tiny grounds passing through the primary one. Thus all grounds are eliminated and you get to taste this smooth and refreshing concoction just the way you like it. Efficient Mechanism - The premium designed mesh filter lets the flavor pass directly into the cup instead of being absorbed by a paper filter. It is apt for those who want pure and consistent coffee with invigorating flavors and aroma. Robust Construction – The carafe is exceptionally strong as it is made using double borosilicate glass that is heart resistant and highly durable. This type of glass is well-known for its ability to withstand thermal shocks, so needless to say, it will never crack. It has excellent longevity and you can continue to use it for years to come. The stainless steel parts inhibit formation of rust and corrosive deposits on the surface. Extremely Versatile – The Kitchsmart French Press is meant for coffee, but you can use it to prepare several beverages including coffee, tea, iced tea, frothed milk, hot chocolate, fruit infusions, almond milk, cashew milk, lemonades, fresh lime soda, and much more. This gadget is a huge time saver for those with hectic schedules because all it takes to whip up your favorite drink is just a few minutes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aNmSVxIfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchsmart","source_asin":"B01CILD4SI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CILD4SI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CILD4SI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981255,"name":"At the Beach III by Master's Art, 26x32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yZK44Kr5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features kids playing at the beach. Masters Fine Art is a company that travels around the world to bring the best in fine art from outstanding artists from different lands. They believe that art is the soul of the world, that it represents our human essence. MFA works mostly with Latin American art. It portrays a happy view of life, represented with bright beautiful colors, music, dance, love, hope and happiness, giving us the feeling that we can overcome all hardships with all the beautiful things we still have in life. The art Masters Fine Art carries is many things: colorful, contemporary, sexy, emotional, musical, romantic. Above all it is beautifull and full of joy. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yZK44Kr5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B006NVV5Y0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006NVV5Y0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006NVV5Y0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981256,"name":"Goodwei Premium Matcha Tea Set - Ceremonial Bowl Chawan, Whisk and Holder + Gift Box (Sumi, 80)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hTz4+pBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The centerpiece of our matcha tea ceremony set \"Burashi\" (jap. \"Brush\") is the elegant, classic-style ceremonial bowl. Handcrafted in a deliberately irregular, wavy shape representing the hilly countryside of Japan. It's thick, glossy glazing with its deep black color features white/blue strokes like from a paintbrush, a reference to japanese art of kalligraphy and sets a nice contrast to the vivid, bright green color of the prepared Matcha. The bottom of the bowl is unglazed, adding to the earthy aesthetic style of this Chawan. Each bowl is unique as there are slight variations in color hue and dripping structure. Slight differences in the temperature of the burning causes crystallization effects in the turquoise glazing. Due to its relatively large diameter of 12 cm and a height of 8 cm the bowl provides ample space to whip the Matcha using the traditional bamboo whisk.  The included Matcha Whisk and Bamboo Scoop are essential accessories for preparing matcha tea and whipping it to achieve a solid, fine frothing. After use, rinse the bamboo whisk with lukewarm water and place it with the bristles facing down on the included whisk holder (jap. \"Chasentate\"). The special shape of the holder ensures that the bristles retain their shape and allow the Whisk to dry faster and better, improving its lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hTz4+pBTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goodwei","source_asin":"B01DW29GXO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DW29GXO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DW29GXO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981257,"name":"SHIVANSH CREATIONS Crystals and Healing Stones, Crystal Pyramid for Meditation and Yoga, Healing Crystals Set for Positive Energy, Pyramid with User M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TwZC2Ng1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ PYRAMID CRYSTAL SET: The Crystal set comes with a gemstone pyramid, a crystal book, a velvet pouch and metaphysical info card. The Pyramid is perfect for keeping in your home, shop, or office for protection, positive energy, and good results. It takes energy to the most perfect state possible. ✅ FOR PEACE OF MIND: The Pyramid is a powerful crystal for activating the higher mind and enhancing intellectual ability. It stimulates the desire for knowledge, truth and understanding, and aids the process of learning. It is excellent for enhancing memory. ✅ FENG SHUI DECORATION : Gem Pyramid is an excellent decoration choice for your office, home, dining table, desk, etc. When used as a feng shui decoration, it can bring a positive atmosphere to the family, and it can also bring sweet dreams when placed on the bedside. ✅ GOOD FOR HOME AND OFFICE : Colourful gemstone Pyramids make great decorative pieces wherever you display them. Be it in your home, office, or garden, these natural crystals add a splash of colour and mystical elegance to your space. ✅ FANTASTIC GIFTS: Perfect for home decoration, you can place it in living room, children's room, office, car, bring you peace, fortune and endless positive energy. It's also a perfect and meaningful gift for your family,friends and yourself on christmas, birthday, thanksgiving day, new year etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TwZC2Ng1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHIVANSH CREATIONS","source_asin":"B07ZC65232","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZC65232","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZC65232","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981258,"name":"Custom Engraved 2 Liter Oak Barrels for Aging Whiskey, Rum, Tequila, Bourbon, Scotch and Wine (2 liter)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ReKflK32L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you like getting more drink for your buck? The only difference between bottom shelf and top shelf liquor is that it was aged longer. How would you like the 20 year scotch taste for the 8 year old price? Or, turn your cheap bottle of whiskey, tequila, rum, bourbon, scotch, brandy or cognac in to a delicious bottle of single barrel, hand crafted reserve? What took them years to do in a large 55 gallon oak barrel you can do at home in just a few weeks. You can! You can also take a $40 bottle of wine and turn it in to a $400 bottle of wine. You can do it all in a Red Head Oak Barrel in just 4 – 6 weeks. These mini American Oak barrels are hand-made by a multi-generational Cooper. They make great gifts since they can be custom engraved for personal pride or great for corporate branding. You can now age and flavor your liquor and wine to the taste you prefer. Our oak barrels are available by size. The size of the barrel is determined by the number of Liters it will hold such as a One Liter Barrel holds 1 Liter or your standard liquor bottle whereas a Twenty Liter Barrel holds roughly 5 Gallons. We also offer Cigar Infusing Barrels. These American white oak barrels are charred on the inside, which is a process that caramelizes the sugar in the wood. Your favorite alcohol is poured into the barrel, sealed with a bung and aged to add depth and character. The spirit (or wine) literally pulls flavor out of the wood, infusing the liquid with earthy and vanilla tones. Hotter temperatures expand the spirit, pushing it into the wood and cooler temperatures draw the liquid and flavor out. This process is repeated everyday, for months. The barrels are pressure sealed with steel hoops, can be engraved with the design of your choice, and comes with a spigot, bung and stand. Red Head Oak Barrels’ American Oak Aging Barrels are available with or without engravings. Perfect for aging any store bought spirit (or even moonshine) or custom cocktail","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ReKflK32L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Red Head Barrels","source_asin":"B01777U8IM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01777U8IM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01777U8IM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
