window.products.push({"id":981300,"name":"Red Co. Set of 4 Plastic Movie Theater Popcorn Buckets, Large 6.75 inch Snack Tubs with Individual Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z4UnVQVHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There is nothing like the smell of freshly popped buttered popcorn. Movie night will never be dull with these light, reusable popcorn buckets, perfect for serving popcorn, chips, candy, or any other snacks. Easy to clean and really versatile as it is both dishwasher and microwave safe. The cheerful tubs are BPA-free, and each has a different design printed on the outer surface. There is the traditional looking popcorn bucket with red and white stripes, a popcorn filled base with blue background, wavy chips, and finally a soccer themed design. No matter which one you choose, there are sure to satisfy your snack crave. Have fun serving your friends and family at parties, during game night, or movie night. Their durable plastic material makes them less vulnerable to accidents should they fall to the ground. The deep buckets are easy to clean and stackable, making them easy to store when not in use. The wide diameter and deep capacity makes them ideal to hold a large quantity of popcorn or any other snacks and foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z4UnVQVHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Red Co.","source_asin":"B09F52Q1X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F52Q1X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F52Q1X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
