window.products.push({"id":981310,"name":"Paris France Eiffel Tower Fridge Collector's Souvenir Magnet 2.5\" X 3.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QcMa5dAJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Here's a brand new, rare and a hard to find collector's item:PARIS FRANCE EIFFEL TOWER FRIDGE COLLECTOR'S SOUVENIR MAGNET 2.5\" X 3.5\". These magnets are made of industrial strength vinyl and are neither flexible nor bendable. They are also water resistant but not waterproof and it's not advisable to keep them in water for prolonged periods of time. These magnets are standard and not 3D (tri-dimensional). Please note : these magnets MAY NOT stick to stainless steel appliances. So please check in advance whether or not the surface you are planning to use is \"magnet friendly\". These are all extremely rare and would make a wonderful addition to anyone's collection or make a great gift! Items will be shipped by USPS in bubble envelopes and will be packed securely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QcMa5dAJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"World By Shotglass","source_asin":"B00AG5JCVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AG5JCVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AG5JCVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981311,"name":"VHC Brands Primitive Bedding-Folkways Red Shower Curtain, Queen (37888)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RYS4o2c7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Bring a folksy but fun element into the bedroom with the Folkways Set. Powerful angles from four burgundy and four mustard triangles give this bedding set a strong \"pop\" on its raven black and creme background. The whimsical and relaxed nature of this set bring feelings of coziness and comfort. FEATURES • Stitch in the ditch, echo, and channel hand-quilting on various plaid and check fabrics • Quilt: Burgundy and mustard plaid friendship stars on black and creme plaid base • Shams: Burgundy and mustard plaid friendship star in center on black and creme plaid base • Straight edge with .5\" bias cut burgundy and black plaid binding • Reverses to black and creme plaid fabric • Quilt: Features two borders in rust orange and burgundy, black, and tan plaid fabrics • Shams: Feature 3 tie closures with 3\" overlap to conceal pillow insert • Patchwork: Hand-quilted, Machine pieced SPECIFICATIONS • Material: 100% cotton shell, 100% cotton batting • Colors: burgundy, mustard, raven • Manufacturer Country: India • Care: Machine wash separately, front load commercial washer. Cold water, gentle cycle, no chlorine bleach. Do not tumble dry. Do not dry clean without first testing a small portion. This product may not withstand commercial cleaning chemicals or process due to the fragility of fabrics and handmade nature. SIZES AVAILABLE • Twin Set • Weight: 4.3 lb • Dimensions: Quilt L86\"xW68\", Sham H21\"xW27\" • Components: 1-twin quilt 86x68, 1-standard sham 21x27 • Queen Set • Weight: 6.3 lb • Dimensions: Quilt L90\"xW90\", Shams H21\"xW27\" • Components: 1-queen quilt 90x90, 2-standard shams 21x27 • Luxury King Set • Weight: 9.6 lb • Dimensions: Quilt L105\"xW120\", Shams L21\"xW37\" • Components: 1-luxury king quilt 105x120, 2-king","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RYS4o2c7L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VHC Brands","source_asin":"B073S313K6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073S313K6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073S313K6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
