window.products.push({"id":981438,"name":"Knox Forest Honey German Incense Cones Made in Germany for Christmas Smokers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BFWSET5nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There is a story to Knox authentic incense cones. More than 135 years ago, chemist Hermann Zwetz founded what has become today's oldest factory for smoking incense in Germany; arguably, it was the largest factory in Europe. Driven by the dream of manufacturing incense in a safe and responsible industrial process, he founded a \"chemical-technical laboratory\". Today is dream lives on in each German Incense burned in an Authentic German smoking man (incense smoker). These can be burned in a cone incense smoker, or on a smoker tray. Each box of Knox Incense contains 24 pieces. Each cone-shaped incense element is designed for any size German Smoker","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BFWSET5nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Knox","source_asin":"B00DZ42HE0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DZ42HE0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DZ42HE0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
