window.products.push({"id":981616,"name":"Charles Viancin - Tomato Silicone Lid for Food Storage and Cooking - 6''/15cm - Airtight Seal on Any Smooth Rim Surface - BPA-Free - Oven, Microwave, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yl0TT78nS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD-GRADE SILICONE LID: This beautifully designed Charles Viancin silicone lid for food creates an airtight seal on any smooth-rimmed surface. Plastic-free, made from BPA-free, food-grade silicone, this reusable lid works on a wide variety of sizes, shapes and materials, including stainless steel, glass, plastic, ceramic and wood. 6” lid designed for containers up to 5.5” in diameter. PERFECT FOR COOKING, REHEATING, AND STORING: Durable construction allows exposure to extreme temperatures ranging from 220°C / 428°F to -40° C / -40°F. Oven safe, stovetop safe, and microwave safe, guard against splatters and spills while retaining heat during cooking and serving. Refrigerator and freezer safe, aid in food preparation and food storage, keeping food fresh and masking unpleasant odors. Not intended for use in a toaster oven. SUSTAINABLE AND HYGIENIC: Reduce the use of single-use, disposable plastic wrap and aluminum foil with this hygienic and plastic-free alternative. Easy to clean, Charles Viancin lids are dishwasher safe or can be washed by hand. Do not carry containers by the lid handle. Lid and bowl must be dry and clean to function properly. AVAILABLE IN DIFFERENT SIZES AND STYLES: This practical lid is available in 4 different sizes: 11''/28cm, 9''/23cm, 8''/20cm and 6''/15cm. Also find our Gift-Boxes, including 4 Lilypad, Sunflower or Tomato lids (11''/28cm, 9''/23cm, 6''/15cm and 4''/10cm). Available in a variety of styles to match your decor and personality, Charles Viancin kitchen accessories make the perfect birthday, shower, or holiday gifts for friends and family! FUN AND FUNCTIONAL: Inspired by the beauty of nature, the Charles Viancin brand provides attractive, clever kitchen accessories perfect for indoor and outdoor dining and entertaining. Designed in France and loved worldwide, enjoy everyday use among our line of plastic-free kitchen essentials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yl0TT78nS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Charles Viancin","source_asin":"B08BBHMSXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BBHMSXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BBHMSXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
