window.products.push({"id":981637,"name":"HATHASPACE Replacement Remote HSP001","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712jFSBUBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Certified Hathaspace remote – Designed and manufactured for the HSP001 Smart True HEPA Air Purifier for Home by Hathaspace. Simple controls – Easily control every feature of your Hathaspace air purifier from anywhere in your room. Long Distance – Use your remote up to 15 ft away from your purifier. Sleek design – Modern design and great functionality. What you get – 1 HSP001 remote (batteries not included), award-winning customer support 7 days a week, and the peace of mind that comes from a trusted American brand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712jFSBUBuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HATHASPACE","source_asin":"B086464GWN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086464GWN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086464GWN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981638,"name":"WarmlyYours 9-Bar Riviera Towel Warmer, Hardwired, Polished Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yftNVWkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\" Bring Spa-Like Luxury To Your Home WarmlyYours brings spa-like luxury into any home with the Riviera Towel Warmer. Its elegant design uses 9 curved bars with horizontal orientation to quickly and evenly distribute heat to warm and dry bath linens. This low-profile towel warmer delivers high-quality performance and has enough space to accommodate 2 large towels or bathrobes at a time, making it ideal for medium to large bathrooms. The bowed rods of this 9-bar towel warmer are cleverly arranged to help keep mildew and dampness at bay, allowing plenty of air flow and an even circulation of heat. Wall-Mounted Design Installs Easily Hard-wired for 120 volts, the Riviera Towel Warmer has a wall-mounted design that is easy to install and provides a cozy 150-watt output of heat. Towels and robes are safely and efficiently warmed with minimal wait times. This sleek towel warmer fits neatly into any bathroom and blends with a variety of decor, without exposed wiring for enhanced aesthetics and function. Included Timer For Optimal Convenience The Riviera Towel Warmer also boasts a 7-day programmable timer for additional convenience. The included timer is easy to use and can be scheduled to start warming at any time of day, guaranteeing toasty towels immediately following a bath or shower or a comforting robe first thing on cold mornings. This included feature is perfect for both busy work weeks and leisurely weekends. Its large backlit display shows time and programming information and can be used in automatic or manual modes, with a temporary override option. Low-Maintenance Stainless Steel is High-Quality The easy-to-clean construction of this stylish towel warmer by WarmlyYours is made with heavy-gauge stainless steel. The towel warmers are available in brushed or polished finishes and are low-maintenance by design. The robust construction of the Riviera Towel Warmer is built to last and will endure the test of time and is backed by a 2-year manufacturer’s warranty. WarmlyYours prides itself on offering the highest quality towel warmers for a variety of bathroom styles and has the ideal solution for any need. The Riviera Towel Warmer is especially well-suited for medium to large bathrooms and can dry and warm up to two towels at a time. The sturdy 9-bar arrangement of stainless steel rails provides optimal heat with a minimal contour. Wall mounting of this hardwired towel warmer with included timer is simple to install and easy to use. The Riviera Towel Warmer is just one of many ways WarmlyYours promises to bring comfort and convenience into your home. WarmlyYours strives to make everyday luxury a reality in any home. \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yftNVWkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WarmlyYours","source_asin":"B07B4NG95Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4NG95Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4NG95Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
