window.products.push({"id":981766,"name":"Gedy by Nameeks TI81-06 Gedy Tiglio Collection Tall Soap Dispenser, 1.5\" L x 3.12\" W, Blue, 2.34\" x 3.12\" x 6.67\", Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516+Pj6AqRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made in glass and finished with Red. This free standing round liquid hand soap dispenser (part of the Gedy Baltic collection) works well in your contemporary bathroom, plus, it will help always have soap handy. Manufactured in and imported from Italy by Gedy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516+Pj6AqRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gedy by Nameeks","source_asin":"B06ZXS1V19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZXS1V19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZXS1V19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981767,"name":"Picnic Blanket, 71\" x 71\" Large Beach Blanket for 4-6 Adults, Waterproof & Sand Resistant Foldable Outdoor Mat, Spring Summer Great for Beach, Park, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F5XxOLUfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌴【Fashion & 2 in 1 Practical Design】Most picnic blankets look dull and frustrating in drab colors and old-fashioned plaid patterns. We tried to break this down with multiple geometric shapes and a double weave process. Not only that, we also independently innovated the two-in-one design concept. Add a soft blanket to the original waterproof pad. The unique design greatly expands the usage scenarios of picnic mats. 🌴【Excellent Waterproof and Thicker Cushion】The bottom brown cushion is made of durable oxford cloth and waterproof PVC layer to prevent dew and humid air on the ground. The white blanket on the upper level is made of high-quality materials. The superposition of the upper and lower layers increases the thickness of the picnic mat, making your picnic experience more comfortable. 🌴【Expand Large & Fold Small】This picnic blanket can expand to 71\"*71\", and fit up to 4-6 adults, and fold to a small package with its portable belt. The folded picnic mat is small and portable, not only suitable for camping, beach, park and outdoor concerts, but also can be used as indoor floor mat, children's play mat, pet cushion. More food and items can be placed on the picnic mat, so you and your family or friends can get active and enjoy the joy of going out on a picnic. 🌴【Easy to fold & Use multiple times】Whether you roll it up or fold it, you'll have a very easy and effortless way to organize it. This is mainly due to the excellent material of the picnic mat. In addition, our picnic mats are machine washable to remove any meal stains and footprints. After washing, you can store your picnic mat for future use. 🌴【Seller Warm Suggestion】After each use, you can simply wipe the soil, fine sand and stains on the bottom of the picnic mat with a paper towel. This allows for better folding and preservation of the picnic mat. Since our picnic mats have a 2 in 1 design, the top mat can be used as a blanket. If the picnic encounters sudden cooling, high winds, or hot sun, wrap yourself in a blanket to reduce the effects of weather conditions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F5XxOLUfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiny Land","source_asin":"B09XGLWS71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XGLWS71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XGLWS71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981768,"name":"Electric Gravity Salt and Pepper Grinder Set - Automatic Pepper and Salt Mills - 02 Battery Powered Shakers with Blue LED Lights - One Hand Operated -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h2Glf3+yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Automatic Operation - These electric pepper and salt grinders are gravity activated. Simply flip the grinders and you will have fresh ground spices. Allows you to activate the distribution of your favorite spices with one hand, while the other hand is free to handle other kitchen tasks. No need for manual grinding, no buttons to press, great for customers suffering from Chronic Hand Pain. ✅ Adjustable Grind Coarseness - With an adjustable ceramic grinding core, our salt/pepper mills have many grinding levels to grind your spices from ultra-fine to coarse. Just turn the grinder knob at the top of the grinder to get your favorite coarseness. ✅ Blue LED Light - A stunning BLUE LIGHT is not only bright but also gentle. The LED light will turn on automatically when the grinder is in operation, you can see exactly where your seasoning is landing and how much pepper you're adding. ✅ AAA Battery Powered - Filled each spice grinder with 6 x AAA Alkaline batteries (batteries are not included) as per instructions, then simply tilt the salt or pepper grinder upside down, and you will have fresh spices. It provides strong power for these auto salt & pepper mills, and you don't have to do manual grinding anymore. ✅ Large Capacity - This set can contain 180 g of salt and 90 g of pepper. The chamber is made of high quality acrylic material, non-corrosive and antioxidative, makes spices fresh and healthy, and it is more durable than glass. A transparent container with a large mouth design, easy to fill and clean, make you not need to refill your pepper grinder often. ✅ Trusted Brand Quality – Here at Benchusch, we’re focused on quality products and unbeatable customer service. That’s why every salt/pepper grinder combo comes with our fast, reliable support and superior craftsmanship from start to finish. If you are dissatisfied with your purchase, please contact us. Our team will make every effort to respond promptly and successfully resolve all issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h2Glf3+yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Benchusch","source_asin":"B09ZYQPDKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZYQPDKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZYQPDKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
