window.products.push({"id":981791,"name":"Laura Ashley 3x3 Collage 3-Photo Picture Frame (Horizontal) with Silver Metal Edge & Easel, Made for Tabletop Display, Counterspace, Desk, Wall Décor,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xk9b7kEwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Laura Ashley silver-edged collage frame, with a white, mat border, provides a stylish boost to your home décor. Tell a story in pictures by displaying three 3” x 3” photos in one stunning metal and glass frame. If you so choose, you can remove the mat border and display one photo in this frame, which has overall dimensions of 4.1” L x 10.75 W. Showcase your child’s many expressions, or frame beautiful photos from your favorite vacations and create a wonderful collage of memories. The understated elegance to this contemporary frame is noticeable in the trim, metallic edges that surround the white, mat border. Light is reflected in a subtle way off this metallic frame, filling any space with welcome illumination. Take snapshots of your favorite everyday moments and turn them into timeless treasures in this stunning, 3-photo frame. The alluring quality of this collage frame make it an ideal choice for use as a display frame at big events like weddings, birthday parties or anniversaries. All eyes will be drawn to the beauty within the photos, wherever you place this frame. This contemporary frame rests horizontally on any shelf or countertop and can hang vertically or horizontally on any wall. The fabric easel of this frame is soft to the touch, yet sturdy. To insert a photo, simply slide the easel down. Use the built-in hooks to mount the frame on a wall and create your own art gallery. Get creative and bring history to life with a series of black-and-white cityscape shots. Divide up a photograph of a sunset and transform a blank wall. Share the joy these decorative frames bring you with your friends, family, and co-workers, as they make a thoughtful gift for birthdays, the holidays, or any season. [Notes (1): This frame can hang horizontally or vertically. (2) This frame does not stand vertically on its easel]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xk9b7kEwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B091RTWFJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091RTWFJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091RTWFJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
