window.products.push({"id":981818,"name":"Melange Coupe 18-Piece Porcelain Dinnerware Set (White Marble) | Service for 6 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, Soup B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KLAK4441L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"An everyday porcelain dinnerware set designed to last and impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain dinner set that epitomizes durability. We've combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a dinner set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping. - vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F. - microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. - 0 percent porosity for greater durability. - complete set for service of 4 or 6 or 8 or 12. - elegant patterns and lovely glaze. For daily use no dealing with fragile dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Mélange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F everything you need every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and maybe a Mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Understated elegance simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as Gifts and experience the Magic of Mélange. About Mélange Mélange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We Believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We Believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That's why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KLAK4441L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B07HSDSHKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HSDSHKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HSDSHKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
