window.products.push({"id":981883,"name":"Trends International 24X36 Star Wars: Return Of The Jedi - One Sheet 3 Wall Poster, 24\" x 36\", Unframed Version","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E911hVDAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Trends International Collector's Edition wall posters are everyone's favorite room decor! Our posters are created with high-resolution artwork and are printed on glossy poster paper which enhances the colors to make a bold wall decor statement in any room. Decorate the bedroom, bathroom, kid's room, living room, office, dorm, and more! Our art prints are lightweight and ready-to-frame or they can be hung on the wall using poster mounts, clips, push pins, or nails. Add these decorations alongside the other accessories on your party supplies list too! Trends International's wall posters are the perfect way to dress up your parties. Posters make great gifts as well! Whether it's for a Christmas stocking stuffer, a best friend's birthday, or a house warming gift, they'll love receiving a high-quality poster to show off their style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E911hVDAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trends International","source_asin":"B09QDL5M22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QDL5M22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QDL5M22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":981884,"name":"Witch Ball Serenity by Iron Art Glass Designs (4 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pjXunmknL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Witch Balls are hand blown glass spheres, with 3 to 5 strands inside for collecting evil spirits and the like. Each one is unique with color, strands, bubbles, and size. Our glass art Witch Balls begin as clear recycled glass. As the molten hot glass is formed, color glass granules are applied to color 70% to 90% of surface, and to create the design pattern. Leaving clear areas allows sunlight the to brighten the sphere and the strands inside the ball. Each Witch Ball is handcrafted unique, no two are exactly the same. Witch Balls tend to be heavier than a regular ball, and can have a irregular surface from the formation of the strands inside. Color patterns and saturation vary from piece to piece as one would expect from a completely handmade art object. The size is about that of a apple, 4\" diameter (the distance across). These balls are sealed, and will work well as pond floats. Let the magic of our glass artists protect your home. Iron Elegance does its best to provide accurate product details on Amazon. Displayed digital images have the most accurate representation possible. There may be slight differences in color from the image on screen and color of the product you receive due to the user’s screen settings, photo lighting, surfaces photographed on, time of day the photo was taken, and filters applied. Amazon requires items to be imaged on a bright white background. Glass color can look different from natural light to artificial light. When a sphere is presented as a flat image, the camera sees color from both sides of the sphere. Consumer Safety- Our glass ornaments do not represent a safety risk. However, glassware is fragile. If using it beyond the item’s ornamental intent, breakages can occur and broken glass is an injury hazard. Caution should be taken opening of the product package, handling, hanging, and accessibility to children limited. Ornaments are not intended to be worn, nor rubbed on skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pjXunmknL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iron Elegance","source_asin":"B079WQCQWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-981884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079WQCQWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079WQCQWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
